{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transactions\">Transactions</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action And Code Count Filter Find General_ledger GeneralLedgerTransactions Is On Transaction Transactions View\">The <code>Transactions</code> screen displays all general ledger transactions across all accounts and all periods. This comprehensive view is useful for finding, filtering, and summarizing your transactions.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On Transaction Transactions\">Accessing Transactions</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Code On Summary To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">To access the <code>Transactions</code> screen, navigate to the <code>Summary</code> tab.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-presentation text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Summary\">Summary</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Code On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Then click the <code>Transactions</code> button in the bottom-right corner of the screen.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Transactions\">Transactions</span></span></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom To ToDate View\">Customizing Your View</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Code Column Columns Edit EditColumns Is On To ToDate Transaction\">Use the <code>Edit Columns</code> button to specify which columns should be displayed in your transaction list.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/edit-columns\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></a></p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action AdvancedQueries By Code Filter Group On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Use <code>Advanced Queries</code> to filter, sort, or group your transactions by predefined parameters.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/advanced-queries\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AdvancedQueries\">Advanced Queries</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Export Port\">Exporting Data</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Code Copy_to_clipboard CopyTo Is On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">You can use the <code>Copy to clipboard</code> button to copy transactions to an external spreadsheet program such as Excel for further analysis.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/copy-to-clipboard\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Copy_to_clipboard\">Copy to clipboard</span></a></p>",
  "key": "transactions"
}
